{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2023-05-05 05:45:00', 'title': 'FIS SHAREHOLDER ALERT: JAKUBOWITZ LAW REMINDS FIDELITY NATIONAL SHAREHOLDERS OF A LEAD PLAINTIFF DEADLINE OF MAY 5, 2023', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 5, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- JAKUBOWITZ LAW ANNOUNCES THAT A SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT HAS COMMENCED ON BEHALF OF SHAREHOLDERS OF FIDELITY NATIONAL INFORMATION SERVICES, INC. (NYSE: FIS). TO RECEIVE UPDATES ON THE LAWSUIT, FILL OUT THE FORM: HTTPS://CLAIMYOURLOSS.COM/SECURITIES/FIDELITY-NATIONAL-LAWSUIT-SUBMISSION-FORM/?ID=38865&FROM=4 THIS LAWSUIT IS ON BEHALF OF ALL PERSONS OR ENTITIES WHO PURCHASED FIDELITY NATIONAL COMMON STOCK BETWEEN FEBRUARY 9, 2021 AND FEBRUARY 10, 2023, INCLUSIVE.'}